|}'''BB ''Jacaño''''' was a conventional Baliscan [[W:Light aircraft carrier|light aircraft carrier]] and the second and last of the ''Corazón'' class.

''Jacaño'' was in service with the [[Confederal Navy]] from 1959 until 1984, and she served as the flagship of the confederal forces during the 1976-76 [[Camboriú War]].

The ''Jacaño'' was decommissioned in 1984, after which the vessel was converted into a [[W:Museum ship|museum ship]] and was permanently moored in [[Yerba Buena]] as the [[BB Jacaño Museum|BB ''Jacaño'' Museum]].

